      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Two cases of painful lesions of the fingers are presented. Both proved to be Pacinian neuromata, and they are the sixth and seventh such cases reported in the literature. This lesion is rare, but it should be considered in the differential diagnosis of painful lesions of the hand."},
